Deploy to Netlify

After the code is on GitHub:

Log in to Netlify.
Click Add new site → Import an existing project.
Choose GitHub.
Select chalimidi3.
Since this is a static HTML/CSS/JS website:
Build command: (leave blank)
Publish directory: . (or leave as the root if prompted)
Click Deploy site.

Your website will be live in a minute or two, and every future git push will automatically trigger a new deployment on Netlify.

